SUMMARY:Curator’s Tour / Anthony Graham on Maren Hassinger: Living Moving
  Growing
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:Senior Curator Anthony Graham offers a tour of Maren Hassinger:
  Living Moving Growing which he co-curated with Chief Curator Margot Norto
 n. Author of the lead exhibition catalogue essay\, Graham will explore the
  evolution of Hassinger's practice through her material experiments in scu
 lpture\, her long-standing engagement with movement and performance\, and 
 her work with the moving image.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/curators-tour-an
 thony-graham-maren-hassinger\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/
 bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/curators-tour-anthony-graham-maren-hassinger
END:VEVENT
