SUMMARY:Waikiki Brothers
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:A mediocre nightclub cover band strums its way across the forgo
 tten hinterlands of South Korea in Yim Soon-rye’s now-cult classic—sim
 ultaneously deadpan and admiring\, sorrowful and life-affirming—with lea
 d roles for future superstars Hwang Jung-min and Ryoo Seung-bum.\nhttps://
 bampfa.org/event/waikiki-brothers\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.
 city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/waikiki-brothers
