SUMMARY:Little Forest
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:A young professional abandons a Seoul life of coffee shops and 
 office drudgery to return to a rural mountain farm and learn to “make he
 r own time” in this “small film with a very big heart” (Taipei Times
 ). Based on a Japanese manga.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/little-forest\nFro
 m Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
