DTSTART:20261115T213000Z
DTEND:20261115T233000Z
SUMMARY:The Human Condition II: The Road to Eternity
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:In Part II of Masaki Kobayashi’s nine-hour epic about Japan
 ’s occupation of China during World War II\, soldier Tatsuya Nakadai tri
 es to institute more humane procedures in his military unit\, but he only 
 succeeds in attracting the ire of his fellow officers.\nhttps://bampfa.org
 /event/human-condition-road-eternity\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushp
 in.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/human-condition-road-eternity
END:VEVENT
