SUMMARY:Communal Land Care with TERREMOTO and Test Plot
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:Landscape architecture design studio TERREMOTO and nonprofit Te
 st Plot discuss their approach to radical communal land care that cultivat
 es beauty and biodiversity\, and explore the belief that ecological and cl
 imate crises require a repairing of kinship with our lands and a return to
  the commons and to care.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/communal-land-care-ter
 remoto-and-test-plot\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/communal-land-care-terremoto-and-test-plot
